#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Beskikbare herstelwerk: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Onbekende formaat %s. Gebruik text, json, nagios of prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Redaksie kon nie voltooi word nie, dus is %s nie geskryf nie."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "Het %s geskryf. Hersien dit voordat dit gedeel word; waardes ná wagwoord-, geheim-, teken- en gemeenskapsname word gemasker."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Onbekende herstelwerk"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Weier om te herstel sonder --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Kies 'n ondersteunde simptoom en teks- of JSON-afvoer."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Aanvaarde waarskuwing"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Toestelbeskikbaarheid"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "Toesteltoestemmings kon nie geëvalueer word nie."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "Die opgestelde PHP CLI kan nie Doctor-kontroles uitvoer nie."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Doctor-kontroles het misluk of hul tydsbeperking oorskry. Hersien die Doctor-logboek."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Grafieke het opgehou bywerk"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Polproses is stadig"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Toestelle ontbreek of is onbeskikbaar"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Doctor-waarskuwings ontbreek"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Kontroleer die poller-skeduleerder en die betrokke poller-logboek, en verifieer dan 'n nuwe voltooide siklus."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Insameling het moontlik gestop."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Ingesamelde waardes bereik moontlik nie die skyf nie."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Inspekteer die afvoerwagtou en Boost-spoelgeskiedenis; verifieer dat die wagtou leegloop en RRD-tydstempels vorder."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Kontroleer bergingskapasiteit, looptydgids-toestemmings en die laaste RRD-opdatering; neem uitgestelde skryfbewerkings in ag."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "RRD-berging vereis ondersoek."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Insamelingswerk oorskry moontlik sy tydsbegroting."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Vergelyk die siklusduur met die peilingsinterval en inspekteer toestel-tydverstrekings voordat gelyktydigheid verhoog word."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Vergelyk databasistellers tydens 'n stadige siklus en inspekteer navraagplanne voordat bedienerlimiete verander word."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Databasisdruk dra moontlik by tot stadige peiling."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Insamelingsvoorvereistes of bereikbaarheid misluk moontlik."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Verifieer die betrokke toestel se toestemmings, bereikbaarheid, aanmeldbesonderhede en toegewysde poller met Cacti-diagnostiek."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Geskeduleerde kontroles of e-posaflewering verg aandag."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Verifieer skedulerings- en ontvangerinstellings, inspekteer behoue afleweringspogings en stuur 'n Cacti-toets-e-pos."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Moontlike oorsake vereis verifikasie; ooreenstemmende kontroles bewys nie 'n grondoorsaak nie."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Geen oorsaak word deur die beskikbare waarnemings vasgestel nie. Voer vars diagnostiek uit en ondersoek die simptoom direk."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Minstens 24 uur sedert bedieneropstart en FLUSH STATUS. Tellers is kumulatief en kan verskillende terugstelgeskiedenisse hê; bevestig neigings tydens 'n verteenwoordigende werklading voor verstelling."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Kumulatiewe verstellingsadvies word uitgestel: verkry geldige bedryfstyd en minstens 24 uur sedert opstart en FLUSH STATUS. Ontbrekende maatstawwe of 'n inkonsekwente steekproef kan nie databasisgesondheid vasstel nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Databasis-waarnemingsvenster"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Verbindingsmaatstawwe is onbeskikbaar of ongeldig. Kontroleer toegang tot SHOW GLOBAL STATUS en SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; moet nie ontbrekende maatstawwe as 'n onaktiewe bediener hanteer nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Huidige verbindings: %.0f / %.0f (%s); aangetekende piek: %.0f (%s van die huidige limiet)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Hersien verbindingspoeling en poller-gelyktydigheid. Kontroleer die databasisgasheer se geheuespeling voordat max_connections verhoog word; die historiese piek kan 'n ouer limiet weerspieël."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Verbindingskapasiteit"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "InnoDB-bufferpoellesings"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Hersien navraagplanne en die werkstel. Oorweeg innodb_buffer_pool_size slegs nadat beskikbare geheue op die databasisgasheer gemeet is; 'n kumulatiewe misverhouding alleen bewys nie geheuedruk nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Tydelike tabelle op skyf"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Hersien navraagplanne, sortering, groepering en datatipes van tydelike tabelle voordat geheuelimiete verander word. Sommige tabelle moet skyf gebruik; geheuelimiete en berekening verskil tussen MySQL- en MariaDB-weergawes."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Skepping van verbindingsdrade"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Hersien verbindingshergebruik en thread_cache_size. Kontroleer die bediener se draadhanteringsmodus voor verstelling; draadpoel-implementasies tree nie dieselfde op as een-draad-per-verbinding-bedieners nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Hersien stadige-navraag-logboeking, long_query_time en navraagplanne voordat bedienerbuffers verander word. Hierdie teller hang af van die opgestelde stadige-navraag-drempel en identifiseer nie individuele stellings nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Stadige stellings"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Kumulatiewe advies uitgestel totdat die waarnemingsvenster voldoende is."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "Draadkas-advies word nie geassesseer nie: thread_handling is onbeskikbaar of is nie een-draad-per-verbinding nie. Hersien eerder die aktiewe draadpoel-implementasie."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Vereiste tellers ontbreek of is ongeldig: %s, %s. Kontroleer bedienerweergawe-ondersteuning en moniteringstoestemmings."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "'n Teller het teruggestel sedert die vorige steekproef; versamel nog 'n verteenwoordigende interval voor verstelling."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Onvoldoende aktiwiteit: %.0f %s; minstens %d waarnemings word vir hierdie advies benodig."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Tellers is inkonsekwent of is onafhanklik teruggestel. Versamel 'n nuwe verteenwoordigende steekproef voor verstelling."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Die intervalsteekproef is te klein of tellers het teruggestel; versamel nog 'n verteenwoordigende interval voor verstelling."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); ondersoekdrempel: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Kumulatiewe %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); ondersoekdrempel: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Hierdie teller kan geheuegekoppelde tydelike lêers op MySQL uitlaat; 'n lae verhouding sluit nie skyfgebruik uit nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Herdoen-logboek-advies uitgestel totdat die waarnemingsvenster voldoende is en Innodb_log_waits beskikbaar is."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Kumulatiewe Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Ondersoek transaksiegroottes, logbufferdruk en bergingslatensie. Kontroleer die tempo weer onder las voordat innodb_log_buffer_size oorweeg word; hierdie historiese telling is nie bewys van 'n huidige stilstand nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "InnoDB-logbufferwagtye"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "geïnstalleerde Cacti composer.json"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "Cacti %s-installeerdervereiste"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "PHP-versoenbaarheid met geïnstalleerde Cacti"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "Lopende PHP %s; geïnstalleerde Cacti %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Kon nie Cacti se PHP-vereiste vasstel nie. Kontroleer die geïnstalleerde Cacti composer.json of vrystellingsdokumentasie; Doctor neem nie versoenbaarheid aan nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s en < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Vereis %s (%s). Lopende PHP voldoen aan daardie vereiste."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Vereis %s (%s). Lopende PHP voldoen nie aan daardie vereiste nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "%s bespeur; Doctor vereis Cacti 1.2.20 of nuwer."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Ondersteunde Cacti-weergawe"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "PHP stroomop-sekuriteitsondersteuning"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Dit kontroleer die PHP-vrystellingstak, nie of hierdie regstellingsvrystelling op datum is en of u bedryfstelselverskaffer regstellings terugport nie. Cacti-versoenbaarheid word afsonderlik gekontroleer."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "Lopende PHP %s; stroomop-sekuriteitsondersteuningstatus is onbekend of dit is 'n voorvrystelling. Kontroleer https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php en werk Doctor se ondersteuningsdata op."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "Lopende PHP %s; PHP %s ontvang stroomop-sekuriteitsregstellings tot %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "Lopende PHP %s; PHP %s ontvang nie meer stroomop-sekuriteitsregstellings nie; ondersteuning het op %s geëindig. Gradeer op na 'n ondersteunde PHP-tak wat versoenbaar is met u Cacti-installasie, of bevestig sekuriteitsinstandhouding met u bedryfstelselverskaffer."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Vereiste huidige CLI PHP-uitbreidings"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Vereiste web PHP-uitbreidings"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Ontbreek: %s. Installeer hulle deur die bedryfstelsel se pakketbestuurder."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
msgstr "Alle PHP-uitbreidings wat deur die Cacti-installeerder vereis word, is in hierdie PHP-konteks gelaai."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor does not execute configured binaries while running as root."
msgstr "Doctor voer nie opgestelde binêre lêers uit terwyl dit as root loop nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The file name %s is not expected for %s, so Doctor did not execute it."
msgstr "Die lêernaam %s word nie vir %s verwag nie, dus het Doctor dit nie uitgevoer nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running as root, so permission checks describe root rather than the web server or poller account, configured binaries are not executed, and repairs are refused. Run Doctor as the Cacti poller user."
msgstr "Doctor loop as root, dus beskryf toestemmingskontroles root eerder as die webbediener- of poller-rekening, opgestelde binêre lêers word nie uitgevoer nie, en herstelwerk word geweier. Loop Doctor as die Cacti poller-gebruiker."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor privileges"
msgstr "Doctor-voorregte"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running without root privileges."
msgstr "Doctor loop sonder root-voorregte."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Vereiste CLI PHP-uitbreidings"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable is unavailable, so its extensions cannot be checked."
msgstr "Die opgestelde PHP CLI-uitvoerbare lêer is onbeskikbaar, dus kan sy uitbreidings nie gekontroleer word nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "shell_exec() is disabled, so Doctor cannot compare the CLI PHP extensions with Cacti requirements."
msgstr "shell_exec() is gedeaktiveer, dus kan Doctor nie die CLI PHP-uitbreidings met Cacti-vereistes vergelyk nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable did not return a valid extension list."
msgstr "Die opgestelde PHP CLI-uitvoerbare lêer het nie 'n geldige uitbreidingslys teruggestuur nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing from CLI PHP: %s. The web and CLI PHP configurations are separate on many systems."
msgstr "Ontbreek uit CLI PHP: %s. Die web- en CLI PHP-opstellings is op baie stelsels afsonderlik."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI has every extension required by Cacti."
msgstr "Die opgestelde PHP CLI het elke uitbreiding wat deur Cacti vereis word."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "GD TrueType support"
msgstr "GD TrueType-ondersteuning"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Recommended PHP features"
msgstr "Aanbevole PHP-kenmerke"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unavailable: %s. Cacti can run without these features, but related functionality may be limited."
msgstr "Onbeskikbaar: %s. Cacti kan sonder hierdie kenmerke loop, maar verwante funksionaliteit kan beperk wees."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The optional gettext, SNMP, and GD TrueType features are available."
msgstr "Die opsionele gettext-, SNMP- en GD TrueType-kenmerke is beskikbaar."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (%dM or more is recommended)"
msgstr "memory_limit is %s (%dM of meer word aanbeveel)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (60 or more is recommended)"
msgstr "max_execution_time is %d sekondes (60 of meer word aanbeveel)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "date.timezone is not set"
msgstr "date.timezone is nie gestel nie"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unset"
msgstr "nie gestel nie"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s. Current values: %s"
msgstr "%s. Huidige waardes: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP runtime configuration"
msgstr "PHP-looptydopstelling"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database connection"
msgstr "Databasisverbinding"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Query failed: %s"
msgstr "Navraag het misluk: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A read-only query completed successfully."
msgstr "'n Leesalleen-navraag is suksesvol voltooi."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database returned an unexpected result."
msgstr "Die databasis het 'n onverwagte resultaat teruggestuur."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Doctor could not determine the database server version from %s."
msgstr "Doctor kon nie die databasisbediener-weergawe vanaf %s bepaal nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported database server"
msgstr "Ondersteunde databasisbediener"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s %s detected; this Cacti branch recommends %s %s or newer."
msgstr "%s %s bespeur; hierdie Cacti-tak beveel %s %s of nuwer aan."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database character set is %s and collation is %s. Cacti requires utf8mb4."
msgstr "Databasis-karakterstel is %s en sortering is %s. Cacti vereis utf8mb4."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "onbekend"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database character set"
msgstr "Databasis-karakterstel"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database timezone support"
msgstr "Databasis-tydsone-ondersteuning"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The Cacti database account cannot read mysql.time_zone_name. Grant SELECT access and populate the database timezone tables."
msgstr "Die Cacti-databasisrekening kan nie mysql.time_zone_name lees nie. Ken SELECT-toegang toe en vul die databasis-tydsonetabelle in."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible and contains %d entries."
msgstr "Die databasis-tydsonetabel is toeganklik en bevat %d inskrywings."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible but empty. Populate the system timezone tables."
msgstr "Die databasis-tydsonetabel is toeganklik maar leeg. Vul die stelsel-tydsonetabelle in."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Core tables used by Cacti are present."
msgstr "Kerntabelle wat deur Cacti gebruik word, is teenwoordig."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing core tables: %s. Restore or upgrade the database before attempting other repairs."
msgstr "Ontbrekende kerntabelle: %s. Herstel of gradeer die databasis op voordat ander herstelwerk probeer word."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Core database tables"
msgstr "Kerndatabasistabelle"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is missing (%s)"
msgstr "%s ontbreek (%s)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not writable (%s)"
msgstr "%s is nie skryfbaar nie (%s)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Runtime directories"
msgstr "Looptydgidse"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The cache, log, and RRA directories exist and are writable."
msgstr "Die kas-, logboek- en RRA-gidse bestaan en is skryfbaar."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cacti configuration file"
msgstr "Cacti-opstellingslêer"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "include/config.php ontbreek of is onleesbaar."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is readable. POSIX mode-bit checks do not apply on Windows."
msgstr "include/config.php is leesbaar. POSIX-modusbis-kontroles geld nie op Windows nie."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is writable by other users. Remove world-write permission because this file contains database credentials."
msgstr "include/config.php is skryfbaar deur ander gebruikers. Verwyder wêreld-skryftoestemming omdat hierdie lêer databasis-aanmeldbesonderhede bevat."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is group-writable. Confirm that every member of the owning group is trusted."
msgstr "include/config.php is groep-skryfbaar. Bevestig dat elke lid van die eienaargroep vertrou word."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is readable by all local users and contains database credentials. Restrict it to the owner and the web server group."
msgstr "include/config.php is leesbaar deur alle plaaslike gebruikers en bevat databasis-aanmeldbesonderhede. Beperk dit tot die eienaar en die webbedienergroep."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is readable and is not world-readable, group-writable, or world-writable."
