#: setup.php
msgid "Scheduled Checks"
msgstr "Geskeduleerde Kontroles"

#: setup.php
msgid "Run Checks on a Schedule"
msgstr "Loop Kontroles op 'n Skedule"

#: setup.php
msgid "Run every Doctor check in the background after the poller and record each check's status."
msgstr "Loop elke Doctor-kontrole in die agtergrond ná die poller en teken elke kontrole se status aan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Check Interval"
msgstr "Kontrole-interval"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often the scheduled checks run."
msgstr "Hoe gereeld die geskeduleerde kontroles loop."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 15 Minutes"
msgstr "Elke 15 Minute"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Hour"
msgstr "Elke Uur"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 6 Hours"
msgstr "Elke 6 Ure"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Day"
msgstr "Elke Dag"

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Email Addresses"
msgstr "Waarskuwings-e-posadresse"

#: setup.php
msgid "Comma-separated addresses to email when a check starts or stops failing. Leave empty to only log changes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Kommageskeide adresse om na te e-pos wanneer 'n kontrole begin of ophou misluk. Laat leeg om slegs veranderinge in die Cacti-logboek aan te teken."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert on Warnings"
msgstr "Waarsku by waarskuwings"

#: setup.php
msgid "Also alert when a check moves into or out of a warning."
msgstr "Waarsku ook wanneer 'n kontrole na of uit 'n waarskuwing beweeg."

#: setup.php
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Drempelwaardes"

#: setup.php
msgid "Poller Run Time Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Poller-looptydwaarskuwing (persent)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the last main-poller run used this share of the polling interval. Runs that take the whole interval always fail."
msgstr "Waarsku wanneer die laaste hoof-poller-lopie hierdie deel van die poller-interval gebruik het. Lopies wat die hele interval duur, misluk altyd."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Warning (percent)"
msgstr "RRA-skyfvryruimtewaarskuwing (persent)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Waarsku wanneer vrye spasie op die RRA-lêerstelsel onder hierdie persentasie daal."

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Misluk wanneer vrye spasie op die RRA-lêerstelsel onder hierdie persentasie daal."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Failure (percent)"
msgstr "RRA-skyfvryruimtemislukking (persent)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Warning (seconds)"
msgstr "Klokdryfwaarskuwing (sekondes)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Waarsku wanneer die databasis- en PHP-klokke met meer as dit verskil."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Failure (seconds)"
msgstr "Klokdryfmislukking (sekondes)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Misluk wanneer die databasis- en PHP-klokke met meer as dit verskil."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRD Stale Intervals"
msgstr "Verouderde RRD-intervalle"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn after this many collection intervals without a file update (1 to 100)."
msgstr "Waarsku ná soveel insamelingsintervalle sonder 'n lêerbywerking (1 tot 100)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Additional disk-write delay for external caching (0 to 86400). Boost adds its own allowance."
msgstr "Bykomende skyfskryfvertraging vir eksterne kasberging (0 tot 86400). Boost voeg sy eie speling by."

#: setup.php
msgid "Deferred RRD Write Allowance (seconds)"
msgstr "Uitgestelde RRD-skryfspeling (sekondes)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Cacti-logboekgroottewaarskuwing (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Waarsku wanneer die Cacti-logboek groter as hierdie grootte word, wat gewoonlik beteken dat logboekrotasie nie loop nie."
